SUMMARY:Special Event: Karlous Miller
LOCATION:Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Mississippi native Karlous Miller grew up in a large blended fa
 mily including eight siblings\, who all became a major influence on his edg
 y and boisterous comedy style. After working briefly as a firefighter in Ox
 ford\, he moved to Atlanta in 2005 to pursue a career as a stand-up comedia
 n. He’s been making audiences laugh ever since.\n\nAs a comedian/actor\, 
 Karlous is most known for being a veteran cast member on MTV’s Wild ‘N 
 Out with Nick Cannon. The NBC’s LAST COMIC STANDING alum\, was also be se
 en on MTV’s JOKING OFF\, MTV2’s UNCOMMON SENSE\, BET’s COMIC VIEW\, a
 nd Bill Bellamy’s WHO’S GOT JOKES. He was featured on HBO’s stand-up 
 series ALL DEF COMEDY and performed his 30-minute special on Kevin Hart’s
  Laugh Out Loud Network. Karlous has also guest starred in the sitcom FAMIL
 Y TIME for Bounce TV and co-hosts MTV’s: What’s My Secret.\n\nHe’s a 
 huge fan of hip hop and has worked with musicians like Jermaine Dupri\, Cas
 e\, Gucci Mane\, Dem Franchize Boyz\, Grandaddy Souf\, Big Oomp and T.I.'s 
 Grand Hustle Comedy.\n\nKarlous has become the voice of this generation wit
 h a huge social media following. Every week\, Karlous hosts the hit 85 SOUT
 H SHOW podcast with DC Young Fly and Chico Bean\, which has gained a fan ba
 se across the globe. As co-host and creator of the 85 SOUTH SHOW\, he has b
 een nominated for the iHeart Radio Best Comedy Podcast.\n\nAs a member of t
 he Atlanta-based comedy trio 85 South\, Karlous is a two-time host of BET
 ’s Hip Hop Awards and is currently a featured comedian on the In Real Lif
 e Tour. As a stand-up comedian\, he frequently performs to sold-out audienc
 es nationwide.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 fo
 od & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nM
 anagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facilit
 y who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https
